  "description": "His girlfriend of five years broke up with him and left for France!\n\nUnable to speak a word of French, Ki-Chan heads to France to chase his ex-girlfriend. There, he saves a woman named Kim Nam-Ju from being pickpocketed, only to witness her boyfriend kissing another woman. After a series of twists and turns, Ki-Chan finally arrives at his lodgings, only to be mistaken for a stranger and kicked by his roommates...\n\nLife in France, where he's embarked on without any preparation, isn't going smoothly! The faint romance between Ki-Chan and Nam-Ju unfolds in their Parisian apartment, \"Marengo 77,\" and the lively chatter of six friends.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
